          </costs>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Shark Tooth Talisman" typeId="7079-589c-df69-fa7e" typeName="Battlekit" hidden="false" id="71ce-919f-34b8-bd63">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="3f15-74a1-4d35-3642">Equipment</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="2b32-2f45-9c06-7a77">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="5093-5528-b08f-1496">CONSUMABLE, NEGATE FEAR</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">Blood Frenzy: Once during a game, a model with a Shark Tooth Talisman can invoke a Blood Frenzy. If they do so and any model (friend or foe) within 1&quot; of the model with the Shark Tooth Talisman has 1 or more BLOOD MARKERS, add +1 DICE to the Success Rolls for Melee Attacks made by the model with the Shark Tooth Talisman for the rest of their Activation.</characteristic>
